    "note": "Other: 3rd Engrossment, 2024-05-02. The House passed the bill as amended on 2024-05-02 (68-64); amendments made after the version read, if any, are not in the text read. The bill strikes the old negligent-storage offence (loaded firearm where a child is likely to gain access). Subd. 3 lists exceptions (transport, shooting sports, hunting, peace officers, police stations) that are not quoted."
